      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] 5th Oct: enter_invoice drafts\nVoltway's invoice 4471 from the PDF:\n18,000 × Rs.1,332.80 = Rs.2,39,90,400. Two\nsuppliers sent a 4471, so it confirms the\nsupplier first. → approval loop: Priya\napproves it the same day",
