      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] drafts \"Returned\" (approval\nloop) and tells Priya, Emma and Vikram\nthe same day. A new supplier account\nneeds a call to the number on file, a\nRs.1 test, Vikram's approval and a\n24-hour hold before an off-cycle re-\nissue",
