    {
      "id": "bc_note_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3444.0,
      "y": 6625.0,
      "width": 732,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "f4",
      "index": "b8c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1408739247,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 512529239,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793750000000,
      "created": 1793750000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why it works this way\n- Emails can be faked; the bank's statement and return file cannot be\n  sent by an outsider, so only they decide paid or returned\n- The reader that touches email text has no tools, so instructions\n  hidden in an email have nowhere to go\n- The agent never changes anything because an email asks it to\n- A return is known the next morning, not at month-end reconciliation\n- Before its first payment run, a changed bank account gets a call-\n  back, a Rs.1 test, Vikram's approval and a 24-hour hold",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bc_note",
      "originalText": "Why it works this way\n- Emails can be faked; the bank's statement and return file cannot be\n  sent by an outsider, so only they decide paid or returned\n- The reader that touches email text has no tools, so instructions\n  hidden in an email have nowhere to go\n- The agent never changes anything because an email asks it to\n- A return is known the next morning, not at month-end reconciliation\n- Before its first payment run, a changed bank account gets a call-\n  back, a Rs.1 test, Vikram's approval and a 24-hour hold",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
