      "seed": 446402843,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1075040594,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793750000000,
      "created": 1793750000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A. Rubber-stamping. If Priya approves 98% of the agent's drafts unchanged, she will start approving without reading.\n  How do we keep her check real: plant an occasional deliberate error to see if she catches it, or track how long she\n  looks at each draft? And who is accountable when a wrong entry she approved reaches Ledgerline?\nB. Conflicting bank evidence. The bank's email says \"credited\" but the statement shows nothing for two days, or the\n  other way round. How long does the agent wait, which source wins, and what does it tell Priya and Emma meanwhile?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "oq",
      "originalText": "A. Rubber-stamping. If Priya approves 98% of the agent's drafts unchanged, she will start approving without reading.\n  How do we keep her check real: plant an occasional deliberate error to see if she catches it, or track how long she\n  looks at each draft? And who is accountable when a wrong entry she approved reaches Ledgerline?\nB. Conflicting bank evidence. The bank's email says \"credited\" but the statement shows nothing for two days, or the\n  other way round. How long does the agent wait, which source wins, and what does it tell Priya and Emma meanwhile?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
